 ('Two-domain allocations: export/import/ack/return with per-boundary durable commits, certificates, pinned roots', 'native/domains.py (migration 043)', [8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 16, 17, 18, 20], ENV, 'returns only full-and-unspent; one allocation lifecycle per id; irrevocable exports sacrifice availability'),
 ('Durable transport: signed envelopes, online courier + file bundle, tombstones, limits, no code execution on import', 'native/domains.py inbox/outbox, native/courier.py', [9, 13, 14, 16, 35], ENV, 'application-level asynchronous transport; not BPv7/LunaNet'),
 ('Bounded disconnected spending: preallocations, cut link, exhausted authority, revocation epochs', 'native/domains.py, connectivity flag, rotation', [13, 14, 34], ENV, 'software-only delegated authority can be cloned; equivocation is detected, not prevented'),
 ('Recovery and quarantine: durable watermark outside the database, peer observations, reconstruction as locked backing', 'native/domains.py rollback_check/recovery_reconcile', [15, 19], ENV, 'a restore that also restores the watermark is detected only through a peer; no peer = undetectable'),
 ('Disputes bounded to the obligation; key rotation with grace; no retroactive authority', 'native/service.py disputes; domains.py rotate_authority', [33, 34], ENV, 'resolution by reviewer/administrator; no external arbitration'),
