 ('Resource- and communication-aware procurement with FIFO/cheapest baselines; resource envelopes and offer claims in eligibility', 'native/procurement.py; terms resource_envelope; board eligibility', [26, 27], 'synthetic held-out workload; explicit supplied contact scenarios', 'energy claims are declared (measured/estimated labels), not metered by the service'),
 ('Evidence acquisition inside the mission: declared states that disagree on the route decision, useful purchase through the native account, redundant declined', 'lunar/evidence.py + decision package', [28], 'finite declared states; observations simulated', 'finite-model guarantees only; not real-world validity'),
